IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAYSET01.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY PAYREC.
01 WS-SETTLE-COUNT            PIC 9(8) VALUE 0.
EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA END-EXEC.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-DISPATCH-SETTLEMENT.
    EXEC SQL
        UPDATE SETTLEMENT_LEDGER
        SET STATUS = 'SET',
            SETTLED_AT = CURRENT TIMESTAMP
        WHERE PAYMENT_REF = :PAY-REF
    END-EXEC.

    IF SQLCODE = 0
        ADD 1 TO WS-SETTLE-COUNT
    END-IF.

    EXEC CICS RETURN END-EXEC.
